,"signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-29T23:46:43-07:00","id":1405250,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>g3taso</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1405222-2e-dragon-blooded-wants-unnatural-influence#post1405222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please folks, tell me this is possible. Tell me a canon artifact or hearthstone or something can give my character unnatural influence.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why though?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-30T05:05:24-07:00","id":1405309,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>g3taso</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1405222-2e-dragon-blooded-wants-unnatural-influence#post1405222\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please folks, tell me this is possible. Tell me a canon artifact or hearthstone or something can give my character unnatural influence.</div> </div> </div> </div>*shrugs* <br /> <br /> Just invent a new charm to do it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-31T07:47:52-07:00","id":1405573,"title":"","content":"Why? To erode and replace Intimacies quickly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3814-g3taso","user":"g3taso","date":". 07-31-2020, 08:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3814-g3taso","name":"g3taso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3814_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-02T03:11:12-07:00","id":1405905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>g3taso</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1405222-2e-dragon-blooded-wants-unnatural-influence?p=1405573#post1405573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why? To erode and replace Intimacies quickly.</div> </div> </div> </div>I guess I asked for that one.<br /> <br /> Unnatural Mental Influence is just that. It's using magic to rewrite people's minds.<br /> <br /> Why do you want to mind-control people to change what they care about and believe in (&quot;erode and replace Intimacies&quot;)? What is your character trying to do? Are you an Immaculate Missionary, forcibly converting folks? Are you a subversive trying to start a civil war? Are you playing the world's best bard, spreading peace and love through song? Are you an insane torturer trying to make an army of Reeks?<br /> <br /> You're asking for mind-control powers. I understand that you want them to control people's minds. I'm asking why you want to control people's minds. What's the purpose? The goal? The end game?<br /> <br /> If you just want to rewrite Intimacies, you can Stunt to get around the 2WP limit. Align those Intimacies with a character's Motivation and folks might just go along with you anyway.<br /> <br /> And why are you a Dragon-Blooded? Solars have loads of UMI options. A subversive is probably better as a Lunar. The world's best bard is better as a Sidereal. If you're playing a DB specifically because they're less powerful than a Celestial, UMI risks skewing that balance point. (But, yeah, sorcery is probably your best bet. There's also artifice -- off-hand the Crown of Thunders in Oadenal's Codex grants UMI and Compulsion. Or Martial Arts, Laughing Monster Style or Righteous Devil Style for example.)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1405222-2e-dragon-blooded-wants-unnatural-influence?p=1405309#post1405309\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*shrugs* <br /> <br /> Just invent a new charm to do it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I strongly feel UMI goes against Dragon-Blooded themes.<br /> <br /> UMI is what makes Anathema anathema. It's why you can bargain with fellow Terrestrials but draw your sword as soon as a Celestial opens their mouth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":531,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","user":"JohnDoe244","date":". 08-02-2020, 06:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}